      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.priority</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the priority of the ANP, determining the order in which they should be evaluated. Lower priority rules have higher precedence. ANP accepts values of 0-99 with 0 being the highest priority and 99 being the lowest.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.subject.namespaces.matchLabels</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the set of pods in the cluster on which the rules of the policy are to be applied. In the example, any pods with the <code>apps: all-apps</code> label across all namespaces are the <code>subject</code> of the policy.</p></dd>
      </dl>
